# Firmware generated outputs (PlatformIO / ESP-IDF; package 0.2).
# Tracked: platformio.ini, CMakeLists, sources, sdkconfig.defaults,
# partitions CSV and the component-manager dependencies.lock.
firmware/.pio/
firmware/build*/
